"长时间满载会让 Mac 发热、风扇升速、降频或快速耗电；本工具默认会在 Critical 热状态或 Serious 持续过久时自动停止。" = "Long full load can heat the Mac, raise fan speed, throttle, or drain power. By default the tool stops on Critical, or when Serious lasts too long.";
"受控负载" = "Controlled Load";
"自动停止" = "Auto Stop";
