"不碰磁盘" = "No Disk Work";
"只运行 CPU worker 与 Metal compute" = "Only CPU workers and Metal compute run";
"到时、Critical 或 Serious 超时停止" = "Stops on duration, Critical, or Serious timeout";
"权限不足时继续显示 thermalState" = "Keeps thermalState when restricted";
"不联网，不上传硬件数据" = "No network upload of hardware data";
"不执行写盘、修复或清理命令" = "No write, repair, or cleanup commands";
"保存 session 摘要与日志" = "Saves session summaries and logs";
"选择这次压力测试压哪一部分：CPU 只压处理器，GPU 只压 Metal compute，CPU + GPU 会联合烤机。" = "Choose what to load: CPU stresses the processor, GPU runs Metal compute, and CPU + GPU runs both together.";
"到达设定时长后会自动停止，并保存历史记录。" = "Stops automatically at the selected duration and saves a history entry.";
"每个 worker 都是一条 CPU 原生浮点压力线程。拉到逻辑核心数时功耗最高；新版会在小批次之间让出调度，保证停止和采样仍能响应。" = "Each worker is a native CPU floating-point stress thread. Setting it to the logical core count gives the highest load, while small scheduling yields keep stop and sampling responsive.";
"一次提交给 Metal compute 的并行工作量。数值越高，GPU 同时处理的数据越多，显存与调度压力也会更高。" = "Parallel work submitted to Metal compute. Higher values keep more GPU work in flight and add memory/scheduling pressure.";
"每个 GPU work item 内部重复计算的次数。数值越高，单次 Metal 任务越重，适合提高持续 GPU 负载。" = "Repeat count inside each GPU work item. Higher values make each Metal task heavier and help sustain GPU load.";
"macOS 把系统热状态分为 Nominal、Fair、Serious、Critical。开启后，一旦进入 Critical，本工具会停止负载，避免继续加压。" = "macOS thermal states are Nominal, Fair, Serious, and Critical. When enabled, the tool stops load as soon as Critical appears.";
"Serious 表示系统已经明显热压。这里设置允许 Serious 持续多久；超过后会自动停止，适合长时间烤机时做保护。" = "Serious means clear thermal pressure. This grace period controls how long Serious may last before stopping the test.";

"显示总功耗、CPU 功耗和 GPU 功耗随时间变化。峰值代表瞬时冲高，持续平台更接近长期稳定烤机功耗。" = "Shows total, CPU, and GPU power over time. Peaks are short bursts; sustained plateaus better represent long-run stress power.";
"显示 CPU、GPU 和芯片/SoC 温度趋势。这里更关注温度变化方向和最高点，而不是单个传感器的平均值。" = "Shows CPU, GPU, and SoC temperature trends. Focus on direction and high points, not an average across sensors.";
"显示 E 核、P 核与 GPU 频率趋势。压力、温度或功耗限制出现时，频率通常会先下降。" = "Shows E-core, P-core, and GPU frequency trends. Frequency often drops first when temperature or power limits appear.";
"显示 CPU/GPU 在采样窗口内的活跃比例。它能帮助判断功耗偏低是因为没有打满，还是因为系统限频或调度策略。" = "Shows CPU/GPU active ratio in the sample window. It helps tell low power from low load, throttling, or scheduling behavior.";
"显示硬盘、存储芯片热点、Wi-Fi、掌托/环境和气流等模块温度。不同 Mac 暴露的传感器数量会不一样。" = "Shows disk, storage hotspot, Wi-Fi, palm-rest/ambient, and airflow temperatures. Sensor coverage varies by Mac.";
"显示风扇转速随时间变化。低负载时 macOS 可能让风扇停转，0 RPM 是正常散热策略，不代表读取失败。" = "Shows fan speed over time. At light load, macOS may stop fans; 0 RPM is normal and does not mean the read failed.";
"这里集中展示最近采样的功耗、温度、频率、负载、模块温度和风扇转速曲线。曲线用于观察趋势，单点数值请结合实时监测卡片一起看。" = "Collects recent power, temperature, frequency, load, module temperature, and fan curves. Use curves for trends and cards for exact current values.";

"硬件温度与散热" = "Hardware Temps & Cooling";
"采样与降级状态" = "Sampling & Fallbacks";
"采样来源" = "Sample Source";
"权限状态" = "Permission";
"温度来源" = "Temp Source";
"温度传感器" = "Temp Sensors";
"电源" = "Power Source";
"CPU 相关温度传感器中的代表值，通常取当前可读 CPU 传感器里的最高点，用来观察处理器热压力。" = "Representative CPU-related temperature, usually the hottest readable CPU sensor. It is useful for watching processor thermal pressure.";
"GPU 相关传感器中的代表值。运行 Metal 压力测试时，这个数值能反映图形核心区域的升温。" = "Representative GPU-related temperature. During Metal stress tests, it reflects heat around the graphics cores.";
"SoC/PMU 等芯片区域的综合热点温度。Apple Silicon 把 CPU、GPU 和控制器集成在同一颗芯片上，所以它很适合看整颗芯片热状态。" = "Composite hot spot around SoC/PMU chip areas. Apple Silicon integrates CPU, GPU, and controllers, so this is useful for whole-chip heat.";
"当前可读风扇转速。低负载下 macOS 可能让风扇停转，因此 0 RPM 属于正常散热策略。" = "Current readable fan speed. At low load, macOS may stop the fans, so 0 RPM can be normal.";
"系统盘 SMART 温度，来自内置硬盘健康读数；它更接近硬盘本体温度。" = "SMART temperature for the system disk. It is closer to the drive's own temperature.";
"AppleSMC 暴露的 NAND/存储区域热点，可能高于硬盘 SMART 温度，代表的是存储芯片附近的热区。" = "AppleSMC NAND/storage hot spot. It may be higher than SMART disk temperature because it reflects the storage chip area.";
"无线模块附近的温度，适合观察机身内部非 CPU/GPU 区域的热变化。" = "Temperature near the wireless module, useful for non-CPU/GPU thermal changes inside the chassis.";
"机身内部气流或进出风附近温度，通常用于判断散热环境，不等于芯片热点。" = "Airflow or inlet/outlet temperature inside the chassis. It describes cooling air, not chip hot spots.";
"当前数据从哪里来。Helper 表示由后台特权程序读取，root powermetrics 表示可读取功耗和频率。" = "Where the current data comes from. Helper means the privileged background tool; root powermetrics can read power and frequency.";
"当前 powermetrics 和 Helper 是否具备足够权限。权限不足时，App 会继续显示可读取的数据并明确降级。" = "Whether powermetrics and Helper have enough access. If not, the app keeps showing readable data and marks the fallback.";
"温度数据使用的接口。AppleSMC/HID 可读取更多本机传感器；powermetrics 主要提供功耗、频率和部分系统字段。" = "Temperature interface in use. AppleSMC/HID can expose more local sensors; powermetrics mainly provides power, frequency, and some system fields.";
"已匹配到的 CPU、GPU、SoC 温度传感器数量。数量越多，说明当前机型暴露的温度信息越完整。" = "Number of matched CPU, GPU, and SoC temperature sensors. More sensors usually means better thermal coverage on this Mac.";
"能效核心集群频率，适合观察低功耗核心在压力或后台负载下的工作状态。" = "Efficiency-core cluster frequency, useful for observing low-power cores under stress or background load.";
"性能核心集群频率。CPU 烤机、渲染和编译等重负载主要会拉高这部分频率。" = "Performance-core cluster frequency. CPU stress, rendering, and compiling mainly raise this frequency.";
"GPU 当前频率。Metal 压力测试时可以用它判断图形核心是否保持活跃。" = "Current GPU frequency. During Metal stress tests, it helps judge whether graphics cores stay active.";
"当前供电来源和电量状态。接电、充电和电池电量会影响系统功耗策略。" = "Current power source and battery state. AC power, charging, and battery level can affect power policy.";
"这是当前采样中的一项硬件状态，用于辅助判断压力测试期间的功耗、温度或降级情况。" = "A hardware state from the current sample, used to judge power, temperature, or fallback behavior during stress testing.";

"当前整机 SoC/封装侧功耗。优先使用 powermetrics 的 package power；如果系统只返回分项功耗，则用 CPU、GPU、ANE 等可读分项相加估算。" = "Current SoC/package-side power. Prefer powermetrics package power; if only components are available, readable CPU, GPU, ANE, and other parts are summed.";
"CPU 部分的实时功耗，来自 powermetrics。下方活跃度表示 CPU 在采样窗口内的忙碌比例，用来判断压力是否真正打满。" = "Live CPU power from powermetrics. Activity below shows how busy the CPU was during the sample window.";
"GPU 部分的实时功耗，来自 powermetrics。下方活跃度表示 Metal/图形相关 GPU 负载在采样窗口内的忙碌比例。" = "Live GPU power from powermetrics. Activity below shows graphics/Metal GPU busyness during the sample window.";
"当前窗口或本次 Session 里记录到的最高总功耗。瞬时峰值会高于长期稳定功耗。" = "Highest total power in the current window or session. Instant peaks can be higher than sustained power.";
"最近 60 秒总功耗的滚动平均，更接近长时间烤机能稳定维持的功耗水平。" = "Rolling average of total power over the last 60 seconds, closer to sustainable long-run stress power.";
"把采样到的功耗按时间积分得到的估算电量消耗，单位 Wh。它适合看一段测试大概消耗了多少电。" = "Estimated energy in Wh by integrating sampled power over time. Useful for approximate energy use during a test.";
"当前显示的是匹配到的 CPU 相关温度传感器最高值，不是所有核心平均值。用最高值更适合判断烤机安全边界。" = "Shows the hottest matched CPU-related sensor, not an average across cores. The hottest point is safer for stress-test limits.";
"当前显示的是匹配到的 GPU 相关温度传感器最高值，不是平均值。Metal 压力测试时它通常比硬盘或环境温度变化更快。" = "Shows the hottest matched GPU-related sensor, not an average. During Metal stress, it usually changes faster than disk or ambient readings.";
"SoC/PMU 芯片热趋势，来自 AppleSMC/HID 中的 SoC、PMU TDie/TDev、PMGR SoC Die、TPD/TRD/TCDX/TCMb/TCMz 等系统暴露的芯片传感器。" = "SoC/PMU chip thermal trend from system-exposed AppleSMC/HID sensors such as SoC, PMU TDie/TDev, PMGR SoC Die, TPD/TRD/TCDX/TCMb/TCMz.";
"当前可读风扇中的最高转速。双风扇机型在数据概览里会拆成左风扇和右风扇分别显示。" = "Highest currently readable fan speed. Dual-fan Macs are split into left and right fan cards in Data Overview.";
"macOS 的系统热状态：Nominal、Fair、Serious、Critical。它是系统综合判断，不等于某一个传感器温度。" = "macOS thermal state: Nominal, Fair, Serious, Critical. It is a system-level judgment, not one sensor reading.";
"当前压力测试 Session 已运行时间。未开始烤机时显示 00:00。" = "Elapsed time for the current stress-test session. Shows 00:00 when no test is running.";
"这次 Session 使用的压力测试模式：CPU、GPU 或 CPU + GPU。不同模式的功耗和温度表现会明显不同。" = "Stress-test mode for this session: CPU, GPU, or CPU + GPU. Power and temperatures can differ a lot between modes.";
"这次压力测试从开始到停止的实际运行时间。下方会显示停止原因，例如用户手动停止或热状态自动停止。" = "Actual run time from start to stop. The detail below shows why it stopped, such as manual stop or thermal auto-stop.";
"本次 Session 里记录到的最高 CPU 温度，取 CPU 相关传感器的最高点。它比平均温度更适合作为安全参考。" = "Highest CPU temperature recorded in this session, using the hottest CPU-related sensor. It is safer than an average for limits.";
"本次 Session 里记录到的最高 GPU 温度。运行 Metal 或联合烤机时，这个值能反映图形核心区域的热压力。" = "Highest GPU temperature recorded in this session. During Metal or combined stress, it reflects graphics-core thermal pressure.";
"本次 Session 中 SoC/PMU 等芯片区域记录到的最高温度。Apple Silicon 把 CPU、GPU 和控制器集成在一起，所以它适合看整颗芯片热压力。" = "Highest SoC/PMU chip-area temperature recorded in this session. It is useful for whole-chip thermal pressure on Apple Silicon.";
"本次 Session 中记录到的最高风扇转速。低负载时风扇可能为 0 RPM，这是 macOS 正常散热策略。" = "Highest fan speed recorded in this session. At light load, fans may be 0 RPM as part of normal macOS cooling.";
"本次 Session 里出现过的最严重 macOS 热状态。Nominal 最轻，Critical 最严重；它是系统综合判断，不等于某一个温度。" = "Worst macOS thermal state seen in this session. Nominal is lightest and Critical is most severe; it is not a single sensor temperature.";

"CPU 内核" = "CPU Cores";
"CPU 品牌字符串" = "CPU Brand String";
"物理核心" = "Physical Cores";
"逻辑核心" = "Logical Cores";
"性能核心" = "Performance Cores";
"效率核心" = "Efficiency Cores";
"主显示器" = "Main Display";
"未读取到外接显示器" = "No External Display Reported";
"Apple Silicon 主芯片，CPU/GPU/统一内存控制器都在同一封装中。" = "The main Apple Silicon chip. CPU, GPU, and unified memory controller share the same package.";
"这里显示 CPU 物理核心组成。性能核心负责高负载计算，效率核心负责低功耗任务；逻辑核心是系统调度看到的可执行单元。" = "Shows the physical CPU core mix. Performance cores handle heavy work, efficiency cores handle lower-power work, and logical cores are what the scheduler sees.";
"这里显示 Apple 芯片集成 GPU 的核心数量。图形、Metal compute 和部分视频/图像任务会使用它。" = "Shows the integrated Apple GPU core count. Graphics, Metal compute, and some media tasks use these cores.";
"Apple Silicon 使用统一内存，CPU 和 GPU 共享同一套高速内存池。" = "Apple Silicon uses unified memory shared by CPU and GPU.";
"当前正在运行的 macOS 版本与构建号。系统版本会影响 powermetrics、传感器 key 和硬件接口可见性。" = "Current macOS version and build. OS version can affect powermetrics fields, sensor keys, and hardware-interface visibility.";
"Darwin 是 macOS 的底层内核版本，适合排查系统级行为差异。" = "Darwin is the underlying macOS kernel version, useful for system-level diagnostics.";
"Mac 从上次开机或重启到现在经过的时间。长时间未重启时，后台状态可能影响压力测试结果。" = "Time since the Mac last booted or restarted. Long uptime can affect stress-test results through background state.";
"默认隐藏序列号、UDID、平台 UUID 等可识别设备的信息。可以在设置里手动开启显示。" = "Serial number, UDID, and platform UUID are hidden by default. You can reveal them in Settings.";
"这是从 macOS 系统接口读取到的本机配置项，只用于本机展示，不会上传。" = "This configuration item comes from macOS system interfaces and is only shown locally.";
"性能核心适合烤机和渲染，能效核心更省电。Cinebench 这类负载主要会把性能核心拉高。" = "Performance cores suit stress tests and rendering; efficiency cores save power. Cinebench-like loads mostly raise performance cores.";
"Metal GPU 压力测试会使用这些 GPU 核心执行 compute kernel。" = "Metal GPU stress tests use these GPU cores to run compute kernels.";
"统一内存由 CPU/GPU 共享，容量会影响大型渲染、模型和素材任务。" = "Unified memory is shared by CPU/GPU. Capacity affects large rendering, model, and media workloads.";
"这些字段可以识别具体设备，默认隐藏；开启后仅在本机界面显示，不会上传。" = "These fields can identify a specific device. They are hidden by default and only shown locally if enabled.";
"硬件序列号可以唯一识别这台 Mac，分享截图前请谨慎。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The hardware serial can identify this Mac. Be careful before sharing screenshots. Hidden values keep the field position with asterisks.";
"设备 UDID 用于开发和配置描述文件场景，也属于敏感设备标识。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The device UDID is used for development/provisioning and is sensitive. Hidden values keep the field position with asterisks.";
"平台 UUID 是系统层面的设备唯一标识之一，默认隐藏。隐藏时保留字段位置并用星号显示。" = "The platform UUID is a system-level device identifier. It is hidden by default and replaced with asterisks.";
"当前 macOS 版本。不同版本可能影响 powermetrics 输出字段和传感器权限。" = "Current macOS version. Different versions can change powermetrics fields and sensor access.";
"Darwin 内核版本，适合与第三方工具或崩溃日志对照。" = "Darwin kernel version, useful when comparing with third-party tools or crash logs.";
"长时间运行后后台任务、缓存和温控状态可能影响烤机结果。" = "After long uptime, background tasks, caches, and thermal state can affect stress-test results.";
"系统共享名称，不等同于硬件型号。" = "System sharing name, not the hardware model.";
"系统底层报告的 CPU/SoC 名称。" = "CPU/SoC name reported by the system.";
"性能核心和效率核心的数量决定不同负载下的调度与功耗上限。" = "Performance and efficiency core counts shape scheduling and power limits under different loads.";
"实际 CPU 核心数量，不包含线程或虚拟核心概念。Apple Silicon 通常没有超线程。" = "Actual physical CPU core count. This does not include threads or virtual cores; Apple Silicon usually has no Hyper-Threading.";
"系统调度器看到的可并行执行单元数量。CPU Workers 以这个数值为上限。" = "Parallel execution units seen by the scheduler. CPU Workers are capped by this value.";
"高性能核心，长时间 CPU 烤机主要依赖它们拉高功耗。" = "High-performance cores. Long CPU stress tests rely on them to raise power.";
"低功耗核心，适合后台和轻任务，也会参与满核心压力。" = "Low-power cores for background and light tasks. They also participate in full-core stress.";
"统一内存容量，CPU/GPU 共享，和传统独立显存架构不同。" = "Unified memory capacity shared by CPU/GPU, unlike traditional separate VRAM.";
"产品线名称，例如 MacBook Pro。" = "Product line name, such as MacBook Pro.";
"苹果内部硬件型号标识，例如 Mac15,8；排查兼容性时很有用。" = "Apple internal hardware identifier, such as Mac15,8. Useful for compatibility checks.";
"销售/配置型号，不同地区和配置可能不同。" = "Sales/configuration model. It can vary by region and configuration.";
"底层固件版本，系统更新可能会改变它。" = "Low-level firmware version. System updates may change it.";
"启动链路相关版本，通常用于底层诊断。" = "Boot chain version, usually for low-level diagnostics.";
"当前系统报告的图形处理器名称。Apple Silicon 的 GPU 集成在 SoC 内。" = "Graphics processor name reported by the system. On Apple Silicon, the GPU is integrated in the SoC.";
"GPU 核心数量越多，Metal 图形和 compute 并行能力通常越强。" = "More GPU cores usually mean stronger Metal graphics and compute parallelism.";
"system_profiler 当前没有报告在线显示器。" = "system_profiler is not reporting an online display right now.";
"当前连接的显示器及分辨率/刷新率。高刷新率和高分辨率会增加 GPU 显示管线负载。" = "Connected displays, resolution, and refresh rate. High refresh and high resolution increase GPU display load.";
"内置 SSD 的设备名称，来自系统存储信息。" = "Built-in SSD device name from system storage information.";
"存储控制器与系统通信使用的协议。Apple Silicon 内置 SSD 常见为 Apple Fabric。" = "Protocol used between the storage controller and system. Apple Silicon internal SSDs commonly use Apple Fabric.";
"当前系统卷所在内置存储容量和可用空间。" = "Capacity and free space for the internal storage that contains the system volume.";
"系统报告的存储健康状态；这里只做配置概览，不替代硬盘健康工具的完整 SMART 报告。" = "Storage health reported by the system. This is only a configuration overview, not a full SMART health report.";

"本机配置默认隐藏序列号、Provisioning UDID、平台 UUID 等可识别设备的信息。开启后仅在本机界面展示，方便你自查；分享截图或日志前建议关闭。" = "This Mac view hides serial number, Provisioning UDID, and platform UUID by default. Revealing them only affects this local UI; hide them again before sharing screenshots or logs.";
"本 App 不进行后台联网，不上传硬件信息。只有当用户主动点击官网链接时，系统才会交由默认浏览器打开网页。" = "The app does not phone home or upload hardware data. It only opens the website in your default browser when you click the website link.";
"历史记录只保存在本机，包含测试时间、功耗、温度、热状态、传感器摘要和测试配置；不会保存管理员密码。" = "History stays on this Mac and includes test time, power, temperature, thermal state, sensor summary, and configuration. Admin passwords are never saved.";
"默认跟随 macOS 当前语言。更改后点击下方按钮重启 App 生效。" = "Defaults to the current macOS language. After changing it, click the button below to restart the app.";
"安装 Helper 后，App 会通过本地 Unix socket 读取 root LaunchDaemon 返回的 JSON。Helper 只执行固定 powermetrics 采样与只读 AppleSMC/HID 温度读取，不接受任意命令。" = "After installing Helper, the app reads JSON from a local Unix socket served by a root LaunchDaemon. Helper only performs fixed powermetrics sampling and read-only AppleSMC/HID reads; it does not accept arbitrary commands.";
"首次安装会弹出 macOS 管理员密码授权。安装后无需以 root 启动 App；如果 helper 不可用，界面会继续明确降级。" = "First install asks for the macOS admin password. After that, the app does not need to run as root. If Helper is unavailable, the UI clearly shows fallback status.";
"数据只保存在本机 Application Support 目录，不联网、不上传。历史 JSON 包含采样时间、功耗估算、热状态与测试配置。" = "Data is stored only in this Mac's Application Support folder. It does not upload. History JSON includes sample time, estimated power, thermal state, and test configuration.";
