"SoC 是 Apple Silicon 的主芯片，CPU、GPU、内存控制器和很多协处理器都集成在这里。" = "SoC is the main Apple Silicon chip, integrating CPU, GPU, memory controller, and many coprocessors.";
"本机 Apple Silicon 主芯片型号；压力测试功耗、频率和温度都围绕这颗芯片展开。" = "This Mac's Apple Silicon chip model. Stress-test power, frequency, and temperature revolve around this chip.";
"AppleSMC 暴露的 NAND/存储区域热点，取 TN/TH/Ts/TS 等存储相关传感器中的最高值。它可能代表 NAND 或控制器附近温度，不等同于硬盘 SMART 当前温度。" = "AppleSMC NAND/storage hot spot, using the highest related TN/TH/Ts/TS-style storage sensor. It may represent NAND or controller-area heat, not SMART disk temperature.";
"AppleSMC 的第 1 个风扇转速，通常对应左侧风扇。不同机型的物理命名可能略有差异。" = "AppleSMC fan 1 speed, usually the left fan. Physical naming can vary by model.";
"AppleSMC 的第 2 个风扇转速，通常对应右侧风扇。单风扇或无风扇机型会显示不可用。" = "AppleSMC fan 2 speed, usually the right fan. Single-fan or fanless Macs may show unavailable.";
"性能核心集群频率，来自 powermetrics。长时间满载后如果温度或功耗受限，这里可能下降。" = "Performance-core cluster frequency from powermetrics. It can drop after long full load if temperature or power limits appear.";
"效率核心集群频率，来自 powermetrics。它反映后台和低功耗核心在压力期间的运行状态。" = "Efficiency-core cluster frequency from powermetrics. It reflects low-power core behavior during stress or background load.";
"无线模块或 Airport 相关温度传感器。不同 Mac 暴露程度不同，读不到时会显示不可用。" = "Wireless or AirPort-related temperature sensor. Sensor exposure varies by Mac; unavailable is shown when it cannot be read.";
"无线模块温度" = "Wireless Module Temp";
"旧名称下显示的是 AppleSMC 的 NAND/存储区域热点，不是硬盘 SMART 温度。新版会优先改用硬盘温度或明确标注为存储芯片热点。" = "The old label showed AppleSMC NAND/storage hot spot, not SMART disk temperature. Newer UI uses disk temperature first or labels it as storage hot spot.";
"机身内部气流/进出风附近温度，适合判断整机散热环境。它通常低于芯片热点温度。" = "Internal airflow or inlet/outlet temperature, useful for judging cooling conditions. It is usually lower than chip hot spots.";
"掌托、机身环境或电池附近的低温区传感器，适合判断体感温度趋势，不代表芯片核心温度。" = "Lower-temperature sensor near palm rest, ambient area, or battery. It is useful for feel/skin-temperature trends, not chip-core heat.";
"系统内置主硬盘的 SMART/NVMe 当前温度，优先通过 smartctl 读取，失败时使用 diskutil 的 SMART 温度字段。这个值应接近硬盘健康工具里的主硬盘温度。" = "Current SMART/NVMe temperature for the internal system disk. smartctl is preferred; diskutil SMART fields are used as fallback. This should match disk health tools closely.";

