"比较测试前段与后段的功耗、频率、温度、热状态和降级样本，判断持续释放是否稳定。它是趋势提示，不是认证结论。" = "Compares early and late power, frequency, temperature, thermal state, and fallback samples to judge sustained stability. It is a trend hint, not certification.";

