"设备序列号、Provisioning UDID 与平台 UUID 默认脱敏，仅在你主动开启后于本机显示；App 不会后台上传硬件数据或测试记录，也不读取或保存管理员密码。网速测试仅在你主动开始时连接测速服务，结果与其他历史均只保存在本机。" = "Device serial number, Provisioning UDID, and platform UUID are masked by default and appear only on this Mac when you enable them. The app never uploads hardware data or test history in the background, and never reads or stores administrator passwords. A speed test connects only after you start it; its result and all other history stay on this Mac.";
"仅安装、更新或修复 Helper 时需要 macOS 管理员授权。App 平时不以 root 运行；Helper 只提供本机只读采样，不联网、不接受任意命令，数据不可用时界面会明确标注。" = "macOS administrator approval is required only to install, update, or repair Helper. The app does not normally run as root. Helper performs local read-only sampling, makes no network connections, accepts no arbitrary commands, and unavailable data is clearly marked.";
"压力测试历史、完整 CSV、网速历史与运行日志都保存在本机 Application Support 目录。历史 JSON 保留轻量结果，完整压力采样会随 Session 另存为 CSV；App 不会在后台上传这些文件。" = "Stress history, full CSV files, speed-test history, and runtime logs stay in this Mac's Application Support folder. History JSON stores lightweight results, full stress samples are saved as a separate CSV for each session, and the app never uploads these files in the background.";
