"使用 macOS 自带的 networkQuality 测量下载、上传和负载响应能力，并以 7 次低流量 HTTPS 往返计算空闲延迟与抖动。测试只会在你主动开始后联网，不读取或保存公网 IP、SSID、管理员密码；结果仅保存在本机。" = "Uses macOS networkQuality for download, upload, and loaded responsiveness, plus seven low-traffic HTTPS round trips for idle latency and jitter. It connects only after you start a test, does not read or store your public IP, SSID, or administrator password, and saves results only on this Mac.";
