"就绪" = "Ready";
"下载速度" = "Download";
"接收数据的带宽能力" = "Bandwidth for receiving data";
"下载速度表示网络从测速服务接收数据的能力，单位 Mbps。它会受到 Wi‑Fi 信号、路由器、运营商、服务器距离和同时用网设备影响。" = "Download speed is the rate at which data is received from the test service, in Mbps. Wi-Fi signal, the router, ISP, server distance, and other active devices can all affect it.";
"上传速度" = "Upload";
"发送数据的带宽能力" = "Bandwidth for sending data";
"上传速度表示网络向测速服务发送数据的能力，单位 Mbps。视频会议、云盘同步和发送大文件会明显依赖它。" = "Upload speed is the rate at which data is sent to the test service, in Mbps. Video calls, cloud sync, and large file transfers depend heavily on it.";
"空闲延迟" = "Idle Latency";
"网络空闲时的往返时间" = "Round-trip time while the network is idle";
"空闲延迟是网络未被大量占用时的一次往返耗时，越低越好。实际视频会议与游戏体验还要结合抖动和负载响应能力。" = "Idle latency is round-trip time before the network is heavily loaded; lower is better. For calls and games, also consider jitter and loaded responsiveness.";
"抖动" = "Jitter";
"连续往返时间的波动" = "Variation between consecutive round trips";
"抖动使用 7 次低流量 HTTPS 往返的相邻延迟差绝对值平均计算，越低越稳定。网络限制探测时会显示不可用，不会用估算值冒充结果。" = "Jitter is the mean absolute difference between seven consecutive low-traffic HTTPS round trips; lower is more stable. If the probe is blocked, it is shown as unavailable rather than estimated.";
"负载响应" = "Loaded Response";
"网络忙碌时的响应能力" = "Responsiveness while the network is busy";
"负载响应表示网络在下载与上传都很忙时，每分钟仍能完成多少次有效往返，单位 RPM，通常越高越好。它能补充说明视频会议、远程桌面和游戏在占满带宽时是否仍然跟手。" = "Loaded responsiveness is the number of useful round trips completed per minute while download and upload traffic are busy. It is measured in RPM and is generally better when higher. It helps show whether calls, remote desktops, and games remain responsive when bandwidth is saturated.";
