"对 Google、YouTube、X、Instagram 与 GitHub 进行小体积、可取消的 DNS、TCP、TLS 与 HTTP 可达性诊断。平台主页响应只用于判断连接质量，绝不会伪装成平台带宽测速；单一目标失败也不等于整个国际网络不可用。" = "Run small, cancellable DNS, TCP, TLS, and HTTP reachability checks for Google, YouTube, X, Instagram, and GitHub. Homepage responses are used only for connection quality—not presented as platform bandwidth—and one failed target does not mean the entire international route is down.";
"每个目标进行 3 次小流量请求，通常在 10–30 秒内完成。" = "Each target receives three small requests; the run usually completes in 10–30 seconds.";
