"根据各目标连续有效请求的响应波动评分；10 ms 内为最佳区间，波动越大分数越低。" = "Scores the variation between consecutive valid responses for each target. Up to 10 ms is the best range, and greater variation lowers the score.";
"按计划请求逐项统计 DNS、TCP、TLS 与 HTTP 四个阶段的实际成功率；未完成请求不会被算作成功。" = "Measures actual success across DNS, TCP, TLS, and HTTP for every planned request. Incomplete requests are not counted as successful.";
"按有效请求的完整响应平均值分段评分；100 ms 内为最佳区间，超过 1 秒会明显降分。" = "Scores the average full-response time of valid requests in bands. Up to 100 ms is the best range, while results over one second reduce the score substantially.";
"分别统计五个目标是否解析到 IPv4 与 IPv6；表示地址族覆盖，不代表实际流量一定走双栈。" = "Checks whether the five targets resolve over IPv4 and IPv6. This measures address-family coverage, not proof that traffic used both stacks.";
