"尚无有效响应耗时" = "No Valid Response Timing Yet";
"只有获得有效 HTTP 响应后才评估响应速度。" = "Response speed is assessed only after a valid HTTP response is received.";
"完整响应耗时" = "Full Response Time";
"使用有效请求的完整响应平均值分段评分；100 ms 内为最佳区间，超过 1 秒会明显降低分数。" = "Uses the average full-response time of valid requests. Up to 100 ms is the best range, and results over one second reduce the score substantially.";
"尚无足够波动样本" = "Not Enough Variation Samples";
"每个目标至少需要两次有效响应才能计算连接稳定度。" = "Each target needs at least two valid responses before connection stability can be calculated.";
"多目标延迟波动" = "Multi-Target Latency Variation";
"根据各目标连续有效响应的平均波动评分；10 ms 内最稳定，波动越大分数越低。" = "Scores the average variation between consecutive valid responses for each target. Up to 10 ms is most stable; more variation lowers the score.";
"尚无地址族数据" = "No Address-Family Data Yet";
